OL,3,GNEWSA'Excitement and fear' before Star
OL,4,AWars game release
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey studio boss said he felt
OL,7,Fexcitement and "a little bit of fear"
OL,8,Fahead of the launch of the first
OL,9,Fdedicated Star Wars racing game in more
OL,10,Fthan twenty years
OL,12,FFuse Games, based in Guildford,
OL,13,Freleased Star Wars: Galactic Racer on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FMatt Webster, CEO of the independent
OL,17,Fstudio, said launching the game - its
OL,18,Fdebut - felt great but that it was an
OL,19,F"interesting one emotionally".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
